# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the region-read qualification pack (tp4-kvread-next-jobs, docs/prefix-audit-cost.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the window branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the cost.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next-1/<tag>/' *.env).
# A0R REPLACES A0 of the engine-reuse pack (tp4-engine-reuse-jobs/A0-control-audit-attach): the FLAG-OFF CONTROL of the audited pair, on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-audit-r2-kvr (A0's profile plus
# QWEN_FAST_LEVERN_KV_READ=region): every cold build, each answer's hash, the Lever N audit digests read through the region extension, so a digest costs seconds where A0's cost 8.4 minutes (A0 and A1 were
# timeboxed at 90 minutes after ten requests). Same tests as A0. Its smoke and container logs are A1R's reference. Run only after Q1 and Q2 passed. READ: the attach admitted at capacity 262144, every answer completes,
# a digest line and a 'kv read mode=region ... fallback=-' line per exact-length prompt, the replay ledger installed, c2_smoke_check clean (its levern_kv_read_problems rule). Stop rule. Duration (estimate): 75 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-audit-r2-kvr
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
# Knowingly omits concurrent8_steady: without this key c2_serving_job.py refuses the job. The smoke check is unchanged, so the run still ends red on its eight-seat rule; read the logs.
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=audited attach arm (exactness tests): its test list is fixed by the pack protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
